    "text": {
     "en": "Any number multiplied by 0 is 0.\nAny number multiplied by 1 is the same number.\nMultiplying by 10 gives that many tens. 7 × 10 = 70.\nMultiplying by 100 gives that many hundreds. 7 × 100 = 700.\nDivision is the opposite: 70 ÷ 10 = 7 and 700 ÷ 100 = 7."
    }
